---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageShell from "../components/layout/PageShell.astro";
import { site } from "../content/site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for the Pathwisse public website at pathwisse.com"
>
  <PageShell>
    <article class="legal-page">
      <header class="legal-page__header">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-page__date">Last updated: 20 September 2026</p>
      </header>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
          Shaquantum Labs Private Limited ("we," "us," "our") is committed to
          protecting your privacy when you visit the Pathwisse public website at{" "}
          <strong>https://pathwisse.com</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains what information the website collects,
          how we use it, and how you can contact us about your privacy concerns.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>2. Scope of this policy</h2>
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy applies <strong>only</strong> to the public
          marketing website at https://pathwisse.com.
        </p>
        <p>
          The authenticated Pathwisse application at https://app.pathwisse.com
          is a separate service with its own separate experience and data
          practices. This policy does not govern that application or its data
          handling.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>3. Information the website currently collects</h2>
        <p>The Pathwisse public website currently has:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>no user accounts or registration</li>
          <li>no web contact form</li>
          <li>no analytics or tracking</li>
          <li>no advertising trackers</li>
          <li>no intentional first-party marketing cookies</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          The website does not directly collect personal information about you.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>4. Information you choose to send us</h2>
        <p>
          If you choose to contact us by email at
          <strong>pathwisse@gmail.com</strong>, you may voluntarily provide
          information such as:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>your name</li>
          <li>your email address</li>
          <li>your institution (if applicable)</li>
          <li>your role or title</li>
          <li>the content of your message</li>
          <li>other information you include in your email</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Providing this information is entirely voluntary. You decide what
          information to include.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>5. How we use information</h2>
        <p>Information you send us by email may be used to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>respond to your enquiry or request</li>
          <li>communicate with you about your message</li>
          <li>maintain appropriate business correspondence</li>
          <li>
            address operational matters related to your request (e.g., data
            integrity, compliance with applicable law)
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We will not use your information for marketing, advertising,
          analytics, or secondary purposes without your consent.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>6. Cookies and analytics</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>Cookies:</strong> The Pathwisse public website does not
          intentionally use marketing cookies, tracking cookies, or other
          cookies for profiling or analytics purposes. Hosting infrastructure
          may process limited technical information necessary to deliver the
          website to you.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Analytics:</strong> We do not currently use analytics services
          to track visitor behavior on this website.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Third-party services:</strong> The website is hosted on
          Vercel. Vercel's infrastructure may process limited technical
          information, such as request headers and network data, necessary to
          serve the website. We do not control Vercel's technical operations,
          but we expect them to be governed by their own privacy practices.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>7. External links and the Pathwisse application</h2>
        <p>The website contains links to external services, including:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            https://app.pathwisse.com/signup (Pathwisse application sign-up)
          </li>
          <li>https://app.pathwisse.com/login (Pathwisse application login)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          External links may lead to services or experiences not controlled by
          the public website. We do not control the privacy practices of
          external services or the separate Pathwisse application. When you
          leave this website, different privacy practices may apply.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>8. Children and younger users</h2>
        <p>
          The Pathwisse public website is informational and open to all
          visitors, including younger users and students under 18.
        </p>
        <p>
          The website does not currently provide user accounts, registration, or
          a direct data-submission form. If you are under 18 and wish to contact
          Pathwisse by email, we recommend:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Avoiding sending unnecessary personal or sensitive information
          </li>
          <li>
            Asking a parent, guardian, or school representative to assist with
            your enquiry
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Do not share student records, grades, transcripts, or other sensitive
          educational information through the public email contact unless
          specifically requested by Pathwisse through an appropriate channel.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>9. Data security</h2>
        <p>
          We take reasonable care to protect information you send us. However,
          no internet communication can be guaranteed completely secure.
        </p>
        <p>
          Email is not an encrypted channel by default. If you have concerns
          about security, please contact us to discuss appropriate alternatives.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>10. Data retention</h2>
        <p>
          Information voluntarily provided to us by email may be retained for as
          long as reasonably necessary to:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>respond to your enquiry</li>
          <li>maintain appropriate business records</li>
          <li>meet applicable legal obligations</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We do not retain information longer than necessary for these purposes.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>11. Your questions and privacy requests</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, concerns about your
          privacy, or a request regarding information you have provided to us,
          please contact:
        </p>
        <p class="legal-page__contact">
          <strong>Email:</strong>
          <br />
          <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a>
        </p>
        <p>
          We will handle privacy requests in accordance with applicable law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>12. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes
          in our practices, technology, or applicable law. The "Last updated"
          date at the top of this page indicates when the policy was most
          recently revised.
        </p>
        <p>
          If we make material changes that affect how we handle information you
          have already provided, we will make reasonable efforts to notify you.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>13. Contact details</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>Shaquantum Labs Private Limited</strong>
          <br />
          # 8-2-610/A/401
          <br />
          4th Floor
          <br />
          Silver Tower Banjara
          <br />
          Banjara Hills Road No. 11
          <br />
          Hyderabad - 500034
          <br />
          Telangana
          <br />
          India
        </p>
        <p>
          Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a>
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <p class="legal-page__disclaimer">
          <strong>Note:</strong> This Privacy Policy is a production draft
          intended to accurately describe current website practices. It is
          pending professional legal review. If you have legal questions or
          concerns, please contact the company directly.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </PageShell>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: var(--width-reading);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-6);
  }
  .legal-page__header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }
  .legal-page h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }
  .legal-page__date {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-small);
  }
  .legal-page__section {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-7);
  }
  .legal-page h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-h2);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }
  .legal-page h2 + p {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .legal-page p,
  .legal-page ul,
  .legal-page li {
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .legal-page p {
    margin: var(--space-3) 0;
  }
  .legal-page ul {
    margin: var(--space-3) 0;
    padding-left: var(--space-5);
  }
  .legal-page li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }
  .legal-page a {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .legal-page a:visited {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }
  .legal-page a:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
  .legal-page__contact {
    padding: var(--space-4);
    background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-primary);
  }
  .legal-page__disclaimer {
    padding: var(--space-4);
    background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    font-size: var(--text-small);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .legal-page {
      padding: var(--space-4);
    }
    .legal-page__section {
      margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
    }
  }
</style>
